[2026-07-22T21:37:49.996Z] [INFO]         "content": "=== self-hosting-metric.rs: how the share is computed & ratchet checked ===\n3://! Run with `rust-script scripts/self-hosting-metric.rs --since <tag>`. A commit\n4://! is attributed only when it records both of these Git trailers:\n6://! - `Formal-AI-Session: <session-id>`\n7://! - `Formal-AI-Evidence: <repo-relative-path>`\n10://! recorded session id. Changed lines are additions plus deletions reported by\n12://! (see [`is_non_authored_path`]) do not contribute.\n22:const SESSION_TRAILER: &str = \"Formal-AI-Session\";\n23:const EVIDENCE_TRAILER: &str = \"Formal-AI-Evidence\";\n31:/// range that was **94.58% of the whole denominator** (601 765 of 636 240 lines,\n32:/// measured by `experiments/self_hosting_ratchet_replay/replay.py`), so the\n33:/// published share described log volume rather than authored work — in both\n36:/// Rows measured under different definitions are not comparable, so the ratchet\n42:/// File extensions whose content is captured, not authored: CI run logs, agent\n49:/// Dependency lockfiles: written by a package manager, never hand-authored.\n62:    pub self_authored_lines: u64,\n63:    pub changed_lines: u64,\n64:    pub self_authored_commits: u64,\n66:    pub percentage_basis_points: u64,\n77:    pub self_authored_lines: u64,\n78:    pub changed_lines: u64,\n79:    pub self_authored_commits: u64,\n81:    pub percentage_basis_points: u64,\n83:    pub trailing_percentage_basis_points: u64,\n86:pub fn format_percentage(basis_points: u64) -> String {\n92:/// Issue #810: the `Formal-AI-Evidence` gate (`evidence-check` in\n95:/// its own `Formal-AI-Session` id. Because `record_release` measures\n106:///   the commit simply does not count as self-authored. The metric can only\n107:///   under-report, never over-report, so the ratchet stays honest.\n114:pub fn measure(repo: &Path, since: &str, until: &str) -> Result<Measurement, String> {\n118:pub fn measure_with_policy(\n127:        .lines()\n130:    let mut changed_lines = 0_u64;\n131:    let mut self_authored_lines = 0_u64;\n132:    let mut self_authored_commits = 0_u64;\n135:        let lines = changed_lines_for_commit(repo, commit)?;\n136:        changed_lines = changed_lines\n137:            .checked_add(lines)\n139:        let attributed = match commit_has_formal_ai_evidence(repo, commit) {\n140:            Ok(attributed) => attributed,\n149:        if attributed {\n150:            self_authored_lines = self_authored_lines\n151:                .checked_add(lines)\n152:                .ok_or_else(|| \"self-authored line total overflowed u64\".to_owned())?;\n153:            self_authored_commits += 1;\n158:        self_authored_lines,\n159:        changed_lines,\n160:        self_authored_commits,\n162:        percentage_basis_points: percentage_basis_points(self_authored_lines, changed_lines),\n166:/// Whether a path holds captured output rather than authored work.\n169:/// only files evidence contributes nothing either way and the share it reports",
